         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Cartoon deer set. Male horny, female, baby fawn spotted reindeers in different poses isolated on white. Vector illustrations for wildlife, animals family, forest fauna concept</rdf:li>
